{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29116","headline":"瓜洲留别李诩 · 许浑","name":"瓜洲留别李诩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泣玉三年一见君，白衣顦顇更离羣。\n柳堤惜别春潮落，花榭留欢夜漏分。\n孤馆宿时风带雨，远帆归处水连云。\n悲歌曲尽莫重奏，心遶关河不忍闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}